bot v1.0.0
- First major release.
- Refactored/reorganized application feature layers and error wrapping. 
- All bot replies have dedicated embeds.
- Way better errors in terms of user friendlyness. 
- Command registration does not block main bot goroutine.
- Command logs include command name. 
- various bug fixes.

classification v1.0.0
- fixed return code error.
- first major release.
- switched repo to tag based releases rather than relying on branches

